{
  "_note": "Option A tape: github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code, anonymous, dark, desktop. Tape ORDER is page order; the episode re-orders via per-beat `from` offsets (tour1 = title/stars/tagline, catch = free-tier note, install = curl block). All select needles VERBATIM from README 2026-08-23.",
  "url": "https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code",
  "view": "desktop",
  "dark": true,
  "steps": [
